    <briefdescription>
<para>File signature-based scanner (built-in). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Detects known malicious file signatures and patterns:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Executable headers in non-executable MIME types</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Known malware file signatures</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Suspicious file patterns (double extensions, etc.)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Archive bombs (ZIP bombs, decompression bombs) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
